      "id": 1,
      "step": 0,
      "subject": "An idea for Bouquets For Days",
      "body": "Hi Ellie,\n\nI was looking at this page from Bouquets For Days: https://www.bouquetsfordays.co.uk/weddings\nYour wedding page explains that couples can feel unsure about flower choices and that they can start by getting in touch.\n\nI help businesses give visitors clearer answers and a route to human support. One idea worth exploring: Explore a small wedding-enquiry helper using your approved seasonal and process information, with a clear handoff to you for availability, pricing and bespoke advice. Treat it as a test rather than a confirmed need.\n\nWould it be useful if I sent a small FAQ assistant outline specific to your business?",
